  "storyId": "main_4_level_main_04-03_end",
  "groupId": "main_4",
  "stageId": "main_04-03",
  "title": "Artificial Cold",
  "storyCode": "4-3",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "92568b7ee525a8b673f9cec04edca2418fe21dd2cf6fa0da34299b835ff595e0",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三十二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Get moving! ...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "text": "What's going on...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "text": "(Don't make a sound!)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "text": "(Nnnh---)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "text": "(Are they still around?)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "text": "(They're still here...!)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "text": "(They seem to searching for something...)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "text": "(A Reunion member is headed our way! We need to hide!)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Must be my imagination.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "text": "(Can you get a clear shot on him?)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "text": "(We're too far away...)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "text": "(The explosions stopped as soon as they appeared...)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "text": "(They're too spread out. There's no way I'd be able to take out all three at once.)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "text": "(Also, their movements are nothing like those ordinary street thugs.)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "text": "(The other Reunion troops don't seem to be dressed as heavily.)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "text": "(That's right. As you can see, we must be extremely careful. If any of them survive and call for reinforcements, we'll be in serious danger.)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "text": "(On top of that, I see one person over there in Caster attire, and they seem to be testing something.)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "text": "(If they're also able to use Detection Arts...)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "text": "(They might be able to detect us just based upon a bullet we fire.)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "text": "(So basically, our hands are tied. Even though it's a three versus three, it feels like we've been surrounded.)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "text": "(Things aren't looking good. I really dislike this kind of feeling.)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "text": "(Though we're supposed to be the hunters, it feels like all we've been cornered into hiding by bigger prey.)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "text": "(Wait, they seem to be communicating with someone...)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "text": "(I can't hear what they're saying from here. I'm going to get closer.)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "text": "(Don't. It's too risky right now.)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "text": "(It's too quiet. We don't know what kinds of Infected we're facing yet...)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "text": "(If any of them have enhanced hearing, we'll be in trouble.)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "text": "(...What are they waiting for?)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "text": "(Something feels... off about this.)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "text": "(Could it be...)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "text": "(Jessica, are you feeling it too...?)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "text": "(Y-yeah... I'm also...)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "text": "(The temperature is dropping again...)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "text": "(So... cold...)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "text": "(Could they be behind this...?!)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "text": "(...! Jessica, why are you biting your fingers--)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "text": "(So that her teeth don't chatter and make noise.)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "text": "(I don't think that's necessary yet, but what a diligent kid.)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "text": "(To me, you're just a kid too.)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "text": "(...Hah.)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "text": "(As if.)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "text": "(...It's warming back up again. Those three Reunion members left as well.)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "text": "Are they testing the functionality of something...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "text": "...They appeared without making a sound, only leaving a trail of shivering cold in their wake.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "text": "They really are like those 'yetis' from legend.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "text": "Maybe my guess was right.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "text": "They might just be yetis.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "text": "...Found it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "text": "Here's another wall that's been affected by the ice. But, look at this...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "text": "There's a chunk of black Originium lodged in the corner?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "text": "No wonder. The cold wave must have emanated from here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "text": "There are distinct patterns on the wall.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "text": "This chunk of Originium is the epicenter of all this.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "text": "...When I was a mercenary, there was a rumor circulating around.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "text": "In the northwest, the Infected were carrying out guerilla warfare against Ursus.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "text": "Among them was a towering monster.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "text": "As the rumor went, nothing could hold off its advance.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "text": "Shields would be crumpled, weapons would be snapped.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "text": "Everywhere the monster went, only a barren tundra, devoid of life, would remain.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "text": "And within that guerilla force, there was this one squad...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "text": "They were like the chill of winter itself.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "text": "The land was said to freeze underneath their feet.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "text": "Buildings would collapse, turned into nothing more than grains of snow drifting across an empty battlefield.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "text": "The trenches where the Ursus soldiers were stationed became their icy grave.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "text": "Are you saying that...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "text": "Yes. I think this is that very legend...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "text": "...the 'Yeti Squadron.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "text": "Let's keep going. I have a feeling that we're going to find the Reunion base soon.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "text": "Ugh...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "text": "What's wrong?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "text": "Do you smell that as well...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "text": "...the smell of something burning?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
